"cat": "공지사항",
"title": "Join Crimson Desert at G-STAR 2024",
"utc": "2024-10-31T00:00:00Z",
"body": "Crimson Desert will be at G-STAR 2024 in Busan, South Korea from November 14 to 17!\nIf you’re planning on attending, find the Pearl Abyss booth in BEXCO’s Exhibition Hall 1, A02 and get ready to join the Greymane Kliff in his battles.\n\n### ■ G-STAR 2024 Schedule\n\n- November 14, 2024 (Thurs) 10:00 AM – 6:00 PM KST\n- November 15, 2024 (Fri) 10:00 AM – 6:00 PM KST\n- November 16, 2024 (Sat) 10:00 AM – 6:00 PM KST\n- November 17, 2024 (Sun) 10:00 AM – 6:00 PM KST\n**■ Booth Location\n![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/crimsondesert/staticUpload/Board/0c3a82fcfb520241031010936592.png)*** Due to the game's content, you must be 18 or older to enter the booth. Booth staff will be checking IDs and verifying the age of all entrants, so please make sure you have an official piece of ID ready if you want to enter.\nTo those who plan on attending G-STAR 2024, we can’t wait to welcome you to Pywel and have you take up the sword and shield of the lone mercenary, so make sure to drop by!\n![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/crimsondesert/staticUpload/Board/1387598457120241031010831091.png)\n\n### ● Join us on:\n\n» [https://youtube.com/crimsondesert](https://youtube.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://x.com/crimsondesert_](https://x.com/crimsondesert_)\n» [https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_](https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_)\n» [https://facebook.com/crimsondesert](https://facebook.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://discord.gg/crimsondesert](https://discord.gg/crimsondesert)"
