"title": "Crimson Desert is coming to gamescom 2024",
"utc": "2024-07-25T00:00:00Z",
"body": "Crimson Desert is coming to gamescom 2024!\nFor the very first time, Crimson Desert will be open to the public and playable at Pearl Abyss’ own Crimson Desert booth in Cologne, Germany.\nWe’re counting down the days until we can meet those of you who will be attending gamescom as well as gamers from all over the world who are looking forward to Crimson Desert.\n\n### ■ gamescom 2024 Schedule\n\n- August 21, 2024 (Wed) 9:00 AM – 7:00 PM (CEST)\n- August 22, 2024 (Thurs) 10:00 AM – 8:00 PM (CEST)\n- August 23, 2024 (Fri) 10:00 AM – 8:00 PM (CEST)\n- August 24, 2024 (Sat) 9:00 AM – 8:00 PM (CEST)\n- August 25, 2024 (Sun) 9:00 AM – 8:00 PM (CEST)\n* Please refer to the [official gamescom website](https://www.gamescom.global/en/info/opening-times) for a more detailed explanation of this year’s event schedule.\n\n### ■ Crimson Desert Booth Info\n\n![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/crimsondesert/staticUpload/Board/049b23eb63220240814052938296.jpg)\nThe Crimson Desert booth will be located at Hall 6, Stand B011-A010.\nDue to the game's content, you must be 18 or older to enter the booth. Therefore, you must be wearing the appropriate gamescom wristband indicating that you are 18 or older to enter the Crimson Desert booth.\nIf you’re coming to gamescom, make sure to drop by and join the lone mercenary in his fights!\n![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/crimsondesert/staticUpload/Board/2d9b528668e20240814053027652.png)\n\n### ● Join us on:\n\n» [https://youtube.com/crimsondesert](https://youtube.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://x.com/crimsondesert_](https://x.com/crimsondesert_)\n» [https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_](https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_)\n» [https://facebook.com/crimsondesert](https://facebook.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://discord.gg/crimsondesert](https://discord.gg/crimsondesert)"
